From: My2pg contributors
Purpose: expose T21 phase intervals and normalize pgloader-v4 batch-size AST values
Reference: layerware/pgloader clojure runtime at 231ab86778ca5ffd7de40878714760c8b4860cdf
License: this patch is independently authored; it copies no upstream code.

